description:
Pulse Tubes are precision-crafted sound instruments designed to create deep, resonant vibrations through rhythmic striking. Used widely in sound healing sessions, meditation practices, and rhythmic therapy, pulse tubes produce a grounding, pulsating tone that helps regulate energy flow, enhance focus, and induce a calm, centered state. Simple to play yet powerful in effect, they are suitable for both beginners and experienced sound practitioners.<br data-start="577" data-end="580" />Each pulse tube comes <strong data-start="602" data-end="638">complete with a dedicated mallet</strong>, allowing immediate and effortless use.

&nbsp;

Our Pulse tubes are available in three sizes., Small, Medium and Big.
